        openings: ("{V} rented a unit to {D} after the move, and two checks for $1,800 came back from the bank marked account closed. The bank's letter shows the account was closed a month earlier, and {DL} had been here before on {PRIOR}.", "The bank has since admitted that it mislabeled the account and mailed its notice to an old address. {DL} wrote the checks believing there was money to cover them, and a check that fails because of a bank's error is not a crime."),
